---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import GuideCard from '../components/GuideCard.astro';
import { getGuides } from '../lib/content';
const guides=await getGuides();
const features=guides.slice(0,3);
const starterHref=guides.some(guide=>guide.slug==='small-space-desk-setup') ? '/articles/small-space-desk-setup/' : '/guides/';
---
<Layout>
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-line"></span> THE THOUGHTFUL WORKSPACE JOURNAL</p><h1>Less clutter.<br/>More <em>focus.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">A good workspace starts with thoughtful choices. Discover practical guides to a desk that works better for you.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/guides/">Explore the guides <Icon/></a><a class="quiet-link" href="/about/">Get to know MyJourney <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-footnote"><span class="small-circle"><Icon name="check" size={15}/></span><span>Useful advice. Clear tradeoffs. Your choice.</span></div></div>
    <div class="hero-visual"><img class="hero-photo" src="/images/workspace-hero.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt="An illustrative sunlit home workspace with a wood desk, laptop stand, task lamp, and sage desk mat" fetchpriority="high"/><span class="photo-label">A SPACE TO THINK</span><div class="hero-feature"><div><p class="eyebrow">START WITH THE ESSENTIALS</p><h2>Small space. Big possibilities.</h2></div><a href={starterHref} class="round-link" aria-label={starterHref==='/guides/'?'Explore workspace guides':'Read the small-space desk guide'}><Icon/></a></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="category-strip"><div class="container category-grid"><a href="/guides/?category=workspace"><div class="category-icon"><Icon name="desk" size={29}/></div><div><h2>Your workspace</h2><p>Make every inch work.</p></div><Icon/></a><a href="/guides/?category=lighting"><div class="category-icon"><Icon name="lamp" size={29}/></div><div><h2>Better lighting</h2><p>Set the right atmosphere.</p></div><Icon/></a><a href="/guides/?category=accessories"><div class="category-icon"><Icon name="keyboard" size={29}/></div><div><h2>The useful details</h2><p>Small changes, everyday value.</p></div><Icon/></a></div></section>
  <section class="container section-space" id="latest"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE GUIDANCE GOES A LONG WAY</p><h2>Good reads for better work.</h2></div><a href="/guides/" class="text-link">Browse all guides <Icon/></a></div>{features.length ? <div class="guide-grid">{features.map((guide,index)=><GuideCard guide={guide} index={index}/>)}</div> : <div class="empty-state"><h3>The next good read starts here.</h3><p>Our editorial collection is being prepared. Explore how we choose and review our topics.</p><a class="text-link" href="/editorial-policy/">Our editorial approach <Icon/></a></div>}</section>
  <section class="approach-band"><div class="container approach-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR POINT OF VIEW</p><h2>Buy less.<br/>Choose <em>well.</em></h2></div><div class="approach-copy"><p>More gear doesn’t always make a better desk. We start with what you need, explain the compromises, and help you decide what earns its place.</p><a class="text-link" href="/editorial-policy/">How we approach every guide <Icon/></a></div><div class="approach-values"><p><Icon name="check"/> Clear, practical advice</p><p><Icon name="check"/> Evidence before recommendations</p><p><Icon name="check"/> Transparent about paid links</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="container collection-section"><div class="collection-visual"><img src="/images/workspace.svg" alt="Illustration of a simple laptop workspace" width="640" height="420" loading="lazy"/></div><div><p class="eyebrow">BUILD YOUR SPACE, ONE CHOICE AT A TIME</p><h2>Your desk.<br/>Your kind of <em>day.</em></h2><p>Start with the space you have. Find a useful guide, work through the checklist, and make your next choice with a little more clarity.</p><a class="button" href="/guides/">Find a place to start <Icon/></a></div></section>
</Layout>
